    "content": "$\\overrightarrow{OA} - \\overrightarrow{OC}$",
    "rationale": "This is $\\overrightarrow{CA}$, the other diagonal."
   },
   {
    "key": "B",
    "content": "$\\overrightarrow{OA} + \\overrightarrow{OC}$",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: go from O to A, then along AB, which equals OC."
   },
   {
    "key": "C",
    "content": "$\\overrightarrow{OC} - \\overrightarrow{OA}$",
    "rationale": "This is $\\overrightarrow{AC}$, the other diagonal."
   },
   {
    "key": "D",
    "content": "$\\tfrac{1}{2}(\\overrightarrow{OA} + \\overrightarrow{OC})$",
    "rationale": "This is the position vector of the centre, where the diagonals meet."
   }
  ],
  "explanation": "$\\overrightarrow{OB} = \\overrightarrow{OA} + \\overrightarrow{AB}$ and $\\overrightarrow{AB} = \\overrightarrow{OC}$ in a parallelogram.",
